# Tesseract OCR Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------
# Windows: uncomment and adjust paths below
# TESSERACT_PATH=C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe
# TESSERACT_DATA_PATH=C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR\tessdata
#
# macOS (Homebrew): typically no config needed (tesseract is on PATH)
# Linux / Streamlit Cloud: no config needed (installed via packages.txt)
# -------------------------------------------------------
